{"id":302,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It feeds on gemstone crystals. In darkness, its eyes sparkle with the glitter of jewels."},{"games":["Sword","Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon is feared. When its gemstone eyes begin to glow with a sinister shine, it’s believed that Sableye will steal people’s spirits away."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Materials from gems it has eaten float to the surface of its body and can form an infinite number of patterns among individuals."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It digs through the ground with its hard claws and crunches down gems with its thick pointy teeth. Carbink is its favorite food."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It’s a fiend for gemstones, so it stalks Carbink. Unfortunately, Gabite almost always grabs them first."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Sableye digs the ground with sharpened claws to find rocks that it eats. Substances in the eaten rocks crystallize and rise up to the Pokémon’s body surface."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Sableye lead quiet lives deep inside caverns. They are feared, however, because these Pokémon are thought to steal the spirits of people when their eyes burn with a sinister glow in the darkness."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It dwells in the darkness of caves. It uses its sharp claws to dig up gems to nourish itself."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It digs branching holes in caves using its sharp claws in search of food--raw gems. A SABLEYE lurks in darkness and is seen only rarely."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."},{"name":"Stall","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is always the last to use its moves."},{"name":"Prankster","hidden":true,"description":"Gives priority to the Pokémon's status moves."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"cave","color":"Purple","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":302,"name":"Sableye","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,43],[3,310],[9,425],[12,252],[15,50],[18,197],[21,101],[24,154],[27,282],[30,511],[33,421],[36,212],[39,408],[42,428],[45,247],[48,492]],"machine":[332,34,280,339,347,109,399,605,91,409,227,203,412,263,7,374,264,492,202,416,356,360,270,506,63,8,196,286,282,808,113,67,490,232,118,341,189,417,101,220,566,398,809,408,182,60,244,94,240,115,156,317,247,421,285,806,214,555,180,164,241,36,269,851,168,675,9,86,271,261,404,428],"egg":[364,260,368,105,389,259],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2-59","name":"Sableye","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Common","number":"59","artist":"osare","img":"me2/59"},{"id":"sv5-107","name":"Sableye","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"107","artist":"0313","img":"sv5/107"},{"id":"sv4pt5-184","name":"Sableye","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Shiny Rare","number":"184","artist":"nagimiso","img":"sv4pt5/184"},{"id":"sv2-136","name":"Sableye","set":"Paldea Evolved","date":"2023-06-09","rarity":"Rare","number":"136","artist":"Nagomi Nijo","img":"sv2/136"},{"id":"swsh11-70","name":"Sableye","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"70","artist":"Shibuzoh.","img":"swsh11/70"},{"id":"swsh7-67","name":"Sableye","set":"Evolving Skies","date":"2021-08-27","rarity":"Common","number":"67","artist":"Eri Yamaki","img":"swsh7/67"},{"id":"swsh4-105","name":"Sableye","set":"Vivid Voltage","date":"2020-11-13","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"105","artist":"KEIICHIRO ITO","img":"swsh4/105"},{"id":"swsh1-120","name":"Sableye V","set":"Sword & Shield","date":"2020-02-07","rarity":"Rare Holo V","number":"120","artist":"Eske 